{"type": "thinking", "text": "Builder's Workshop (a building upgrade list screen, oddly titled): Inn, Guild Hall, Church... each \"Tier 0 / 3\", next upgrade requires Construction Lv. 20/25, cost, \"Builder's discount: 7% off\".\n\nSo the \"Builder's discount: 7% off\" is the Construction bonus: 0.5% per Construction level → Construction level 14 → 7%. Yes! 0.5% × 14 = 7%. So Construction level is 14, not 15. Then my total-level computation: 14 + 4 others (runecrafting/herblore/firemaking 1 each=3) + slayer 1 = 18; 636+68+18=722? Let me recompute carefully.\n\nKnown:\nCombat: Attack 70, Strength 70, Defense 70, Hitpoints 70, Ranged 40, Magic 40 = 360.\nGathering: Mining 50, Fishing 30, Woodcutting 30, Farming 1, Thieving 1 = 112. Running 472.\nCrafting: Smithing 19, Cooking 25, Fletching 1, Crafting 20, Runecrafting ?, Herblore ?, Firemaking ?, Construction 14. Known sum = 79 + 14 = 93 + 3 unknown (if 1 each = 3) = 96. Running 568.\nSupport: Prayer 45, Mercantile 99, Agility 20 = 164. Running 732!? That exceeds 720. Hmm. Wait, total level 720, but my sum is 732 with Slayer not counted (Slayer might be excluded from total? In RS, Slayer counts. In this app maybe Slayer is separate).\n\nHmm, let me recompute support: 45+99+20 = 164. 472+96 = 568; +164 = 732 > 720. So something's off — maybe Agility isn't 20 or Mercantile isn't 99? The screenshot showed Agility 20, Mercantile 99, Prayer 45. Hmm.\n\nMaybe some skills aren't counted in Total Level (e.g., Slayer, or a prestige reduces level?). Or my gathering/combat numbers are wrong. Attack 70+Strength 70+Defense 70+HP 70 = 280, Ranged 40 + Magic 40 = 80 → 360 ✓. Mining 50 + Fishing 30 + WC 30 = 110, Farming 1 + Thieving 1 = 112 ✓.\n\nCrafting: Smithing 19 + Cooking 25 = 44, Fletching 1 + Crafting 20 = 65, +Runecrafting+Herblore+Firemaking+Construction = 65+3+14 = 82? Wait: 19+25+1+20 = 65; + Runecrafting(1)+Herblore(1)+Firemaking(1) = 68; + Construction 14 = 82. I mistakenly said 93. So crafting = 82. Running total: 360+112+82 = 554. + Support 164 = 718. + Slayer 2 = 720. So Slayer level 2! (Slayer screen said Level 1 with 0 XP — hmm, that's Slayer level 1.)\n\nHmm, 718 + Slayer 1 = 719, off by 1. Maybe Construction 15 or Agility 21? Hmm. Or Crafting level is 21? The Skills tab showed Crafting 20 \"4,470 / 5,018 XP\". Hmm.\n\nMaybe one of the unknown craft skills is level 2. Whatever — Total Level may just count 24 skills and my numbers are approximate. Not needed.\n\nNow -7% with Construction 14 = 7% exactly, good. So the Construction bonus row is correct (0.5% × 14 = 7%).\n\nWait — but Construction level 14 means the Construction skill exists in profile Skills grid; its tile should show 14 and a progress ring.\n\nSo the bonus list's 5 rows all look individually consistent with known data:\n- Attack prestige +5% XP (prestige 1 → +5%)\n- Attack Precision I+II +9 (combat stats)\n- Hitpoints prestige +5% XP\n- Hitpoints Vitality I +4\n- Construction -7% (level 14)\n\nNow what's missing? Infinite Tower bonuses (+7% XP, +12% coin drops, +150 HP) per precondition. So yes: the bonuses section should include those, probably as e.g. \"Infinite Tower +7% XP\", \"+12% coin drops\", \"+150 max HP\" — likely three rows. They're absent.\n\nBut wait: is it certain that the profile bonuses section should include tower bonuses? The change says \"the listed bonuses now come from a new set of sources.\" This strongly implies the list should reflect all bonus sources in the new system, including Infinite Tower per the provided data. The test data explicitly gives tower bonuses — likely to be checked against the bonuses list. So I'll report the missing Infinite Tower bonuses.\n\nHmm, but the tower screen's milestones are unclaimed. If the bonus data says earned, the list should still show. The milestone claim state might be a separate bug (not in our areas).\n\nAlso, are there other missing bonus sources? E.g., quest/guild rewards, pets (none owned), building (Inn tier 0), Gloomharvest? The point is: