el 1? Impossible.\n\nHmm, also Fishing Guild \"4 left today\" and Woodcutting Guild \"Not yet unlocked\" — Shrimp Haul is a Fishing Guild quest; check Fishing Guild to see if Shrimp Haul is completed. If not, then the precondition's \"3 guild quests\" isn't reflected → maybe the \"milestones progress\" bug: guild quest progress not computed from finished records? Hmm, that's ", "truncated": true}
