ting Skills tab shows Smithing I NOT completed! So only 3 skill quests are marked completed in the UI. Plus guild quests: Copper Run ✓, Iron Quota ✗ (Requires Guild Level 1 — shown without Completed), Shrimp Haul (need to check). If guild: Copper Run ✓, Shrimp Haul? Let me check. If Shrimp Haul is completed → 3 + 2 = 5 completed → Dedicated ✓ exactly at 5. Interesting!\n\nIf Smithing I is actually NOT completed despite the precondition, then the milestone progress (5) is consistent with the app's own records but contradicts the precondition. In that case the bug might be that Smithing I's completion record is missing/not displayed! The precondition says Smithing I completed. The app shows it not completed in the Quests screen. Could the bug be that \"finished progress records\" for Smithing I are not counted/displayed? Hmm! But the quest list is in Quests, not profile.\n\nHmm, hold on, maybe Smithing I's \"Completed\" state IS shown but hidden because... In the Crafting Skills tab, completed quests may be sorted differently or hidden? The \"Hide completed\" toggle is OFF (Gathering showed completed ones). So Smithing I simply isn't completed.\n\nHmm, unless the completion state is displayed as a \"Reset\" button only (like Gathering completed ones show \"Completed\" + Reset). Smithing I had no Reset. So not completed.\n\nSo either the precondition is inaccurate or there's a data bug where Smithing I's progress record is missing. This could be exactly the \"progress toward mission milestones computed from all finished progress records\" bug — i.e., some finished progress records are ignored! Hmm, if Smithing I's record is missing from the record set, then achievements counting quests would undercount (but 5 achieved still).\n\nHmm, hmm. Let me check the Fishing Guild's Shrimp Haul to see if it's completed. If Shrimp Haul is completed, then guild quests count 2, total 5 → Dedicated ✓. If Shrimp Haul NOT completed, total = 4 (3 skill + Copper Run) → Dedicated should be