t-data changes: one Mining—Stone session completed/collected (+720 XP, +60 Stone, +1 Sapphire); profile layout restored to Rail.\n- The final Attack skill-tree points consistency check could not be finished because the device connection died.\n\nSince the `sign_off` tool is unreachable, the session can be treated as verified for the areas above, with reports 1–2 still open/tracked."}
